        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legendary Czech freeware game from 1993 returns!</strong><br>Control a locomotive, collect cargo, and watch your train grow longer with every item you pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D classic, you gather items, avoid crashing into your own wagons and walls, and try to complete each level. Once everything is collected, simply pass through the gate to advance to the next stage. Each level has its own password, allowing you to return to it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game now features two modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> – the original game in its unchanged form<br><strong>Extended Mode – a new version with new and special levels</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia or discover a brand new challenge!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legendary Czech freeware game from 1993 returns!</strong><br>Control a locomotive, collect cargo, and watch your train grow longer with every item you pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D classic, you gather items, avoid crashing into your own wagons and walls, and try to complete each level. Once everything is collected, simply pass through the gate to advance to the next stage. Each level has its own password, allowing you to return to it anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game now features two modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> – the original game in its unchanged form<br><strong>Extended Mode – a new version with new and special levels</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia or discover a brand new challenge!</p>",
        "short_description": "The task in this 2D game is to control the train and collect various objects with it, which will be attached to the train in the form of a wagon. After hitting a wall or wagon, the level is reset. After collecting all the objects, just go through the gate to the next level.",
